  "description": "FurCamp Michigan, formerly Northern Michigan FurCamp, is an 18+ furry camping convention organized by FCM Events LLC. It was renamed in September 2024 after settling at the Lake Michigan Recreation Area in Free Soil, Michigan, where there are two large group campsites for tents, with community-run events, swimming, games and s'mores. The first event was a private test run in August 2022, and since 2024 it has been held yearly. Its charity is the Skegemog Raptor Sanctuary.",
